# Pages that name a C symbol that does not exist ON PURPOSE -- gone, or never
# built: `page symbol`, one per line.
# Read by scripts/check_doc_symbols.py (`make doc-symbols-check`).
#
# The list only SHRINKS. An entry whose symbol exists again, or whose page no
# longer names it, fails the gate. A stale name that a page uses as if it
# were current is a defect, not an entry: fix the page.

